Archify Code Analysis

Code Analysis is an integrated module maintained in the Archify repository.

Portions of this module were first developed as the `analyzers/` subsystem
proposed in https://github.com/tt-a1i/archify/pull/352 and include fixes
contributed by tt-a1i (Archify's author):

  - fix(analyzers): preserve import facts and cover extraction regressions
  - fix(analyzers): constrain createRequire to the source module base

